%% Activity diagram: creating an account
flowchart TD
  A([Open Create Account]) --> B[Pick account type]
  B --> C{Customer?}
  C -- no --> D[Show 16 SSN boxes]
  D --> E{Staff?}
  E -- yes --> F[Show venue list and manager email]
  E -- no --> G
  F --> G
  C -- yes --> G[Enter email, phone and password]
  G --> H[Verify email and phone with code 000000]
  H --> I{Password at least 8, both verified, terms ticked?}
  I -- no --> J[Show error] --> G
  I -- yes --> K[Send POST /api/users/register]
  K --> L{Server: email free, SSN ok, venue ok?}
  L -- no --> M[Show the server's message] --> G
  L -- yes --> N[Save account with hashed password and SSN]
  N --> O([Open the role's home screen])
